<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
	  <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
	  <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;NuGet</Configurations>
    <Version>10.7.0-beta1</Version>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
	  <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/CAUCA-9-1-1/cause-security-management</RepositoryUrl>
	  <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/CAUCA-9-1-1/cause-security-management</PackageProjectUrl>
    <AssemblyVersion>10.7.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>10.7.0</FileVersion>
    <Authors>Fred Catellier-Poulin, Michael Jolin, Claudine Gagnon</Authors>
    <Description>Base models for the Cause.SecurityManagement's library.</Description>
    <Copyright>CAUCA 9-1-1 (c) 2025</Copyright>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
10.7.0-beta1 — Adds a permission-based endpoint gate: [AdministratorOrUserWithPermission]
and [UserWithPermission], enabled with AddPermissionBasedAuthorization(). Also includes a
security fix: MultiJwtClaimsTransformer no longer grants the Administrator role to
principals with no issuer claim, which previously affected certificate-authenticated
external systems in applications that do not configure Keycloak. Additive and backwards
compatible; all published packages must be upgraded together. Pre-release — see the
README section on permission-based endpoint authorization for supported registrations.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Company>CAUCA 9-1-1</Company>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
